OFFLINE_TITLE=Why Hindi Learn! works offline
OFFLINE=Hindi Learn! is made to work entirely on your device. There is no account to create and no server behind it: what you write, practise and save stays here, and the app works anywhere, with or without a connection.\n\nThis is a deliberate choice. Online features such as accounts, syncing between devices or cloud backups need servers, and servers cost money every month, for as long as the app exists. Paying for them would mean filling your study sessions with ads that break your concentration, and asking everyone for a monthly subscription on top of that.\n\nHindi Learn! is built and maintained by a single independent developer, and it has to pay its own way. One purchase, with no ads and no subscription, is the fairest way to do that: you pay once, and the app is yours.\n\nTwo things to keep in mind:\n• Handwriting recognition, text recognition and translation use Google’s models on your device. They download once and then work offline too.\n• Your progress lives only on this device. Make a backup now and then in Settings › Your data, and keep it somewhere safe.\n\nThank you for supporting independent software.
