VOICE_STEPS_ANDROID=Hindi Learn! reads words and readings aloud with this device’s text-to-speech, which has no Hindi voice yet. To add one:\n\n1. Tap Open settings below: it opens Text-to-speech output.\n2. As the preferred engine, choose Speech Services by Google.\n3. Tap the gear next to it, then Install voice data › Hindi, and download it.\n4. Come back to Hindi Learn!: the speaker buttons appear by themselves.
VOICE_STEPS_IOS=Hindi Learn! reads words and readings aloud with this device’s voices, and none of them speaks Hindi yet. To add one, open Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices › Hindi and download a voice. Then come back to Hindi Learn!: the speaker buttons appear by themselves.
SPEECH_BETTER_VOICE=For a clearer voice, download a Hindi one in Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices.
